# The interop lane (design.md, D18; plan, Task 2.7): a native peer and a
# peer in headless Chromium connect to each other, signalled through a relay
# on 127.0.0.1 over webcpp::beast's WebSocket, which carries each description
# and candidate as the W3C's JSON. The native peer binds to 127.0.0.1 and has
# no STUN server; Chromium runs with --allow-loopback-in-peer-connection and
# --disable-features=WebRtcHideLocalIpsWithMdns. The native peer sends
# "ping", the page answers "pong". run.mjs drives every part:
#
#   interop_native   two native peers meet through the relay: the relay and
#                    the native peer proved without a browser
#   interop_browser  the native peer meets the page's peer, in the JSPI and
#                    the Asyncify variants, both from one manifest
#
# They run as the own lane interop, natively and on emscripten:
#
#   b2 threading=multi libs/webrtc/test/interop//interop
#   b2 toolset=emscripten libs/webrtc/test/interop//interop
#
# The emscripten run meets the native program, which a native build makes
# first: b2 threading=multi libs/webrtc/test/interop//native-program, or the
# path WEBCPP_WEBRTC_INTEROP_NATIVE names (run.mjs). Playwright is pinned by
# package.json and package-lock.json; the browser is the Chrome that CHROME
# names, else, on macOS, the newest Chromium in Playwright's cache.

# The page's program takes its libraries itself: the driven test that serves
# it must not inherit them.
project : requirements -<library>/webcpp/webrtc//headers ;

import webcpp ;

webcpp.targets native ;

webcpp.original node ;

# The native side, one program: the relay, or a native peer (native.cpp),
# linked by every native build, and its explicit target native-program, which
# the native driven test runs and the emscripten run meets. A driven test is
# built again at every run, so it reuses that program rather than compile
# native.cpp each time. libdatachannel's threads need threading=multi.
webcpp.link native : native.cpp
  : <library>/webcpp/webrtc//webrtc <library>/webcpp/beast//sockets
    <library>/webcpp//boost_json <threading>multi
  : native ;

webcpp.drive interop_native : .//native-program : <webcpp-drive-timeout>120
  : run.mjs : --native : native ;

webcpp.lane interop : interop_native : native ;
